    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 45,
    "summary": "A messianic psalm—The Messiah is fairer than the children of men—He is anointed with the oil of gladness above His fellows—His name will be remembered in all generations.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
