        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 45,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Kings’ daughters were among thy honourable women: upon thy right hand did stand the queen in gold of Ophir.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 17,
            "end": 21
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 45:9",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 45,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Hearken, O daughter, and consider, and incline thine ear; forget also thine own people, and thy father’s house;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 45:10",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 45,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "So shall the king greatly desire thy beauty: for he is thy Lord; and worship thou him.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 52,
            "end": 54
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 45:11",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 45,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "And the daughter of Tyre shall be there with a gift; even the rich among the people shall entreat thy favour.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 25,
            "end": 39
          },
          {
            "start": 53,
            "end": 57
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 45:12",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 45,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
